{
  "note": "ARCH-11-style drift guard for the dev-service descriptor (A6). The canonical grammar is @ax/skills-parser's ServiceDescriptorSchema; @ax/connectors and @ax/sandbox-protocol re-declare it (type-only stance / wire re-validation) and @ax/skill-broker digests it. Every copy asserts this key list and gives the same verdict on every vector. `full` carries every key; `alternates` gives each key a different valid value (skill-broker: each must move the digest). Add a field: add it to `keys`, `full` and `alternates`, then every copy fails until it learns it.",
